  "verdict": "onset/ridge is NOT constant across s_d: 0.18 -> 1.10 -> 1.28; the s_d=0.0025 and s_d=0.04 intervals are disjoint and d ln(ratio)/d ln s_d = 0.70 excludes zero; a common ratio near 1 is rejected"
